We report mean (SE) parameter estimates from our model for each hypothesis. *** denotes $p &lt; 0.001$ and ** denotes $p &lt; 0.01$ ($p$-values are Holm<span id="S6.T7.12" class="ltx_text">-</span>adjusted for multiple comparisons). Significant results are <span id="S6.T7.13" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bolded</span>.</figcaption>
